    "Qualitative full-drone extension, not a flight/contact validated model.",
    "Per latest user instruction, carried-over arm masses already include motor/prop/guard; visual CAD masses are not added again.",
    "47 g moving contains the 35 g distal; central mass is the residual of 970 g total.",
    "Distal COM and inertia are reused from one-arm v2 rather than inferred from heterogeneous CAD volume.",
    "Body inertia is a physical box approximation; paper identified inertia is not decomposed into articulated masses.",
    "Body x forward, y left, z up; motor1 front-right,3 front-left,2 rear-left,4 rear-right.",
    "Original CAD frame JSON pointed the opposite way; yaw axes rotated 180 deg to honor confirmed numbering.",
    "Motor thrust force acts along the moving rotor axis. Geometric PD controller is a surrogate, not RAPTOR/RL.",
    "Contact capsules approximate guard CAD surface. Contact friction and damping are assumptions, not identified impact parameters.",
    "After loading-only hover trim, v2 unloading slope is used around a frozen hover equilibrium, preserving trim force.",
    "Memory presets are fixed per experiment; multi-cycle material identification and domain randomization are future work.",
    "Fixed internal hover preload is computed once from nominal rotor forces and gravitational generalized forces at CAD neutral. It is not active joint control.",
    "The neutral CAD geometry is an assumed hover operating point, not a measured static flight sag prediction."
